    <item>
      <title>D.R.E.A.M. 2025</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/teaching/debate2526/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/teaching/debate2526/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;formato-bp-259&#34;&gt;Formato BP (25/9):&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/dream_1_bp.pdf&#34;&gt;[slides]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercícios&lt;/strong&gt;: Assiste ao seguinte &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FuzIargAnFE&#34;&gt;debate&lt;/a&gt; e, para cada casa, resume o caso num tweet (280 caracteres).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Referências&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;EUDC AdjCore. (2025). EUDC Judge &amp;amp; Debating Manual. Copenhagen EUDC. &lt;a href=&#34;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1f6JmcUNFdF485AA8iBE6mU1BQgUf2tb4/view&#34;&gt;url&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Harper, J. (2014). Roles on the table in British Parliamentary Debating. How to Debate. &lt;a href=&#34;http://howtodebate.blogspot.com/2014/12/roles-on-table-in-british-parliamentary.html&#34;&gt;url&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;análise-de-moções-299&#34;&gt;Análise de Moções (29/9):&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/analise.pdf&#34;&gt;[slides]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercícios&lt;/strong&gt;: Acede ao &lt;a href=&#34;https://debatedata.io&#34;&gt;debatedata.io&lt;/a&gt; e seleciona 5 moções de tipos diferentes. Para cada moção,&#xA;sublinha as palavras que consideras importantes e explica porquê (identifica o tipo de&#xA;moção, agentes, modificadores &amp;hellip;)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
